1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CATALAN%20NOBILITY.htm#ConstanzaAntillonMGombaldoEntenza
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          '''CONSTANZA de Antillón''' ([1265]-[10 Apr 1308/11 Nov 1314]).  The testament of "don Gombalt d´Entenca senyor d´Alcolea", dated 12 Sep 1304, bequeathes property to "la noble dona Goztança d´Antellyo…muller mía…", pub
2 CONC lished 10 Apr 1308 by "dona Goztança d´Antellyón mullyer del dit…don Gombalt d´Entiença"[2265].  Her connection with the Urgell family is confirmed by the marriage contract of her daughter Teresa, dated 11 Nov 1314, which names he
2 CONC r parents "Gombaldi d´Entença et Constancie uxoris eiusdem, nepotemque Ermengaudi quondam comitis Urgellensis"[2266].  Her father´s name is confirmed by the testament of her daughter Teresa which refers to property previously owne
2 CONC d by "Sancii de Antilione avi nostri ac Vallesi de Antilione patrui nostri…"[2267].  Señora de Antillón.  Heiress of Urgell.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' GOMBALD de Entenza Señor de Alcolea, son of BERNAT GUILLEM [I] de Entenza & his wife --- (-[12 Sep 1304/10 Apr 1308], bur Alcolea San Juan). 
