2 CONC arried Arnau Mir of Pallars Jussà.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1135, Ermengol married a second time to Elvira, daughter of Rodrigo of Lara and Sancha of Castile. To this union were born Galceran de Sales and Mary, lady of Almenara.
