1 NOTE OR "PEDRO"; KING OF ARAGON 1276-1285
1 NOTE He ruled from 1276 to 1285. Ih inherited his father's military genius, conquering Sicily and generally stirring up matters between the Aragonese and the Angevins in southern Italy.
