2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly MAYOR Martínez de Sousa Señora de Lavega de Armijo, daughter of JUAN Martínez de Sousa Señor de la Vega de Armijo & his wife Agnes de Casaus.  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Alfonso & his first wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *i)          JUAN Alfonso de la Cerda (-after 1393).  Señor de Puñete y Sardoal.  '''m''' MARÍA de Albórnoz Señora de Villoria, [niece of Cardinal Gil de Albórnoz] daughter of ÁLVAR García de Albórnoz Señor de Utiel Moya y Torralb
2 CONC a & his wife Teresa Rodríguez.  Juan & his wife had three children: 
