2 CONT **(a)        LUIS de la Cerda.  He succeeded his mother as Señor de Villoria.  '''m''' ISABEL de Rojas, daughter of FERNANDO de Herrera Señor de Ampudia & his wife Inés de Rojas.  Luis & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT ***(1)        LUIS de la Cerda (-1469).  He succeeded his father as Señor de Villoria, Castrillo y Ventrosilla.  '''m''' FRANCISCA de Castañeda Señora de Penalba, daughter of JUAN Rodríguez de Castañeda Señor de Hormaza & his wife
2 CONC  Juana de Guzmán (-Seville after 13 Dec 1503).  Luis & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT ****a.          JUANA de la Cerda (-1503).  She succeeded her father as Señora de la Cerda, Castrillo y Ventrosilla.  '''m''' DIEGO de Zúñiga Duque de Bejar. 
2 CONT
