2 CONC ([1290]) MATHILDE, daughter of - (([1272/74]-[1348/53] …. Alfonso & his wife had [eight] children: … 3.         '''LOUIS de la Cerda''' (in France [1291]-La Motte du Rhône 5 Jul 1348).  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos na
2 CONC mes "D. Luis de la Cerda, Juan Alonso, Ines Alonso" as the children of "D. Alonso Guedella" and his wife "D. Mafalda"[1433].  
