2 CONT [Medlands] Infante don PEDRO de Aragón, son of don JAIME II King of Aragon & his second wife Blanche of Sicily (1305-Pisa 4 Nov 1381).  The Crónica de San Juan de la Peña names "el primero…Don Jayme…el secundo Don Alfonso…el terce
2 CONC ro Don Johan…el quarto Don Pedro…el quinto Don Ramon Berenguer" as the five sons of King Jaime II and his wife Blanca, stating that Pedro was "conte de Ribagorça et de Ampurias" but later exchanged Ampurias for Prades with his bro
2 CONC ther Ramón Berenguer[529].  Conde de Ribagorza y Ampurias 1323-1341.  Conde de Prades, Señor de Denia y Gandía 1341-1381.  Seneschal of Catalonia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Betrothed to BEATRIZ de la Cerda, daughter of don JUAN Alfonso de la Cerda, Señor de Gibraleón & his first wife dona Maria de Portugal (in Portugal [1311]-early 1325). 
2 CONT
2 CONT m (Castellón de Ampurias May 1331) JEANNE de Foix, daughter of GASTON I Comte de Foix & his wife Jeanne d'Artois [Capet] (-1357/58).
