2 CONT >9.         Infanta doña MARÍA de Aragón ([1248]-Zaragoza 1267).  The Crónica de San Juan de la Peña names "la primera…Violant…la otra Costancia…et Isabel…la quarta…Maria" as the four daughters of King Jaime and his second wife, s
2 CONC tating that María was unmarried[414].  Nun at Sijena.
