1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Ricohombre de Castilla, alguacil mayor de Sevilla
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20LATER%20MEDIEVAL%202.htm#PedroNunezGuzmanMMaria
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         PEDRO Núñez de Guzmán .  Salazar y Castro records his parentage[59].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' MARÍA de la Cerda, daughter of ---.  Salazar y Castro states that Pedro Núñez de Guzmán, son of Álvaro Pérez de Guzmán, married "doña María de la Cerda"[60].  However, in another section of his work, he says that "doña Mar
2 CONC ía de la Cerda Señora de Gibraleón" was the wife of Pedro´s father[61].  Her parentage has not been ascertained.  Some secondary works state that she was María Alfonso, illegitimate daughter of Juan Alfonso de la Cerda [Castilla] 
2 CONC Señor de Gibraleón, and the connection with Gibraleón makes this an attractive possibility.  The uncertainty about her paternity is noted by Dupont[62].  Pedro & his wife had one child: 
