2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in Seville, daughter of the Castillian nobles Pedro Núñez de Guzmán (descendant of the noble family of Saint Dominic) and Juana Ponce de León (great-granddaughter of King Alfonso IX of León), and sister of Alfonso Núñ
2 CONC ez de Guzmán (ca 1300 – Gibraltar, 1342), Master of the Order of Santiago, married ca 1330 to Dona Dona María de La Cerda, 1st Lady of Villafranca de Valcárcel (ca 1290 –), without issue.
2 CONT
