2 CONT
2 CONT 1. King Pietro II of Sicily, b.1304, d.Calataxibeta 1342; m.1322 Elisabeth, dau.of Duke Otto II of Carinthia
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1. King Luigi of Sicily, b.Catania, d.Iacchi 1355
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1.1.[illegitimate from Leonora Barrese di Militillo] Antonio de Aragon; m.Beatriz, Bssa de Cocentaina, dau.of Pedro de Aragon, Baron de Ejerica, with issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1.1.1. Luigi de Aragona, Barone de Cocentaina.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1.1.2. Yolanda de Aragona.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1.1.3. Richilde de Aragona
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1.2.[illegitimate] Luigi de Aragon, Barone di Tripi, d.after 1374, married to Imperia dei Baroni Lavagna, with issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1.2.1. Giacomo de Aragona.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1.2.2. Eufemia de Aragona, married Giovanni Barrese, Barone di Pietrapersia.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.2.Giovanni (1340-1353), dunm.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.3. King Federigo III of Sicily, Duke of Athens and Neopatras, b.1341, d.Messina 1377; m.1st Catania 1361 Constanza, dau.of King Pedro IV of Aragon; m.2d 1372 Antonia (d.1374) dau.of Francesco del Balzo, Duca d'Andria
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.3.1.Queen Maria I of Sicily, Duchess of Athens and Neopatras (1362/3-1401); m.1389 to King Martin II of Sicily (d.1409)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.3.2.[illegitimate]Guglielmo de Aragon, Cte di Gozzo e Malta, d.after 1380; m.Beatriz de Avola
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.3.2.1.Giovanna de Aragon; m.Pietro di Gioeni, Barone di Ardore
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.4.Constanza, Regent of Sicily 1352-4 (1324-1355)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.5.Leonora, b.1325, d.Lerida 1375; m.Valencia 1349 King Pedro IV of Aragon (d.1387)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.6.Beatrice (1326-1365); m.1345 Ruprecht II, Elector Palatine (d.1398)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.7.Eufemia, Regent of Sicily 1355-7 (1330-1359), dunm.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.8.Violante, b.1334, d.young
