2 CONT Theobald I of Navarre
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT he married Margaret of Bourbon (1232).
2 CONT
2 CONT Theobald died at Pamplona, on a return from one of his many visits to Champagne. He was buried in the Cathedral of Pamplona. He was succeeded first by his elder son Theobald II and then by his younger son Henry I, both children of
2 CONC  his third marriage.
