1 NOTE {geni:about_me} >'''Please don't copy-and-paste''' paragraphs or entire articles from other websites into Overviews. ''Previous copy-and-paste information is removed.'' 
2 CONT >FMG, Archive.org, Wikipedia, The Peerage, (et al) prefer that genealogy websites only provide URLs to their webpages. Most rely on donations or webpage ads to maintain their databases.
