2 CONT 1.         PEDRO Martínez de Luna (-killed in battle Sardinia 1368).  Señor de Almonacid y Pola.  Ayala´s Crónica de Pedro I names “....Don Pedro de Luna, é Don Juan Martinez de Luna, é Don Frey Artal de Luna de la Orden des Espit
2 CONC al, hermano del dicho Don Pedro de Luna, Rico omes del Regno de Aragon” among those who invaded Castile in 1359[885].  Zurita records the appointment of “don Pedro de Luna Señor de Almonezir y Pola” as “Capitan general” in Sardini
2 CONC a in 1367 and the death in 1368 of “don Pedro de Luna y don Felipe de Luna su hermano”[886].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ELSA de Ejérica, daughter of PEDRO de Ejérica [Aragón] Barón de Ejérica & his wife Bonaventura di Arborea ([1340]-after 1380).  Zurita records that “don Pedro de Luna Señor de Almonezir y Pola” was appointed “Capitan gener
2 CONC al” in Sardinia in 1367 “porque doña Elfa de Exerica su muger tenia mucho deudo con el Iuez de Arborea”[887].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Pedro & his wife had children: 
