1 NOTE He deposed his brother Imre's son Ladislas II in 1205. He ruined his country's finances through weakness and was forced by his nobles to sign "The Golden Bull" of 1222 (Hungary's Magna Carta) which gave all lords the right to disa
2 CONC llow any royal act.
