2 CONT [edit] Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Sancho married Maria de Molina in 1282 and they had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Isabella of Castile (1283-1328). Married first James II of Aragon and secondly John III, Duke of Brittany.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Ferdinand IV (1285-1312).
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Alfonso (1286-1291)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Peter (1290-1319) married Maria daughter of James II of Aragon
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Enrique (1288-1299)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Felipe (1292-1327). Married his cousin Margarita de la Cerda, daughter of Ferdinand de la Cerda, Infante of Castile.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Beatrice of Castile (1293-1359). Married Afonso IV of Portugal.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had several bastard children before his marriage as well. by an unknown woman:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Teresa Sanchez, who married Joao Afonso de Menezes, the 1st Earl of Barcelos, Portugal
2 CONT
2 CONT by Maria Afonso Teles de Menezes:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Violante Sanchez, who held the dowry of Uzero, married Fernando Rodriguez de Castro, Lord of Lemos.
2 CONT
2 CONT by Maria Perez:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Alfonso Sanchez, who married Maria Diaz de Haro, without issue.
