2 CONT 6.             CHARLES de France (Creil, Oise 18 Jun 1294-Château du Bois de Vincennes 1 Feb 1328, bur église de l'Abbaye royale de Saint-Denis).  Comte de La Marche 1314.  He succeeded his brother in 1322 as CHARLES IV "le Bel" K
2 CONC ing of France, CARLOS I King of Navarre.  He was consecrated at Notre-Dame de Reims 21 Feb 1322.  The necrology of Sainte-Chapelle records the death "Kal Feb" of "Karoli Francie et Navarre regis"[436].  m firstly (before Apr 1308,
