1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''MARÍA Núñez'''
2 CONT d/o  NUÑO Fernández Cogominho & Margarita de Albarnaz
2 CONT x  ?FERNANDO de Aragón
2 CONT
2 CONT FERNANDO de Aragón .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Pedro de Aragon, D. Fernando que fue asaz bueno, i casó" as the sons of "D. Pedro de Aragon" and his wife "D. Constança Mendez Petite"[584].  m '''MARÍA Núñ
2 CONC ez, daughter of NUÑO Fernández Cogominho & his wife Margarita de Albarnaz.'''  Salazar y Acha does not record Fernando’s marriage, although he says that he died “sin hijos”[585].  The primary source which confirms the information 
2 CONC has not been identified. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ARAGON%20&%20CATALONIA.htm
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Filha de Nuno Fernandes Cogominho , Almirante-mór do Reino (1er), senhor de Chaves , c.1255 , falecido em 1316, Cavaleiro, almirante-mor de D. Dinis e chanceler do infante herdeiro D. Afonso casado com Margarida Albernás , nascida
2 CONC   na cidade de Lisboa , falecida depois de 1316. Enterrada na Sé de Lisboa.
