1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Roger IV of Foix
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger IV (died 24 February 1265), son and successor of Roger-Bernard II the Great, was the seventh count of Foix from 1241 to his death. His reign began with the south again at war with the north in France and, though he was reluc
2 CONC tant to join his father's old ally, Raymond VII of Toulouse, in revolt and he did not aid the king of England, Henry III, in his Saintonge War.
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger IV was a vassal of both the count of Toulouse (for his county of Foix) and the king of France (for his Carcassonne lands), then Louis IX. His loyalty to the king, however, took precedence and war broke out with Raymond VII (
2 CONC October 1242). Though Raymond was forced to submit to the king on November 30, the war with Roger continued until January 1243, when the king ended it. The count of Foix was now solely a vassal of the king and Raymond spent the re
2 CONC st of his life (until 1249) trying to retrieve Roger's homage, to no avail.
2 CONT
2 CONT Like his father, Roger IV had troubles with the church and the bishop of Urgel in particular and, in 1257, he successfully released the viscounty of Castelbon from the bishop's jurisdiction. In February 1245, he gave many freedoms
2 CONC  to his subjects and he signed paréages with the abbots of Mas-d'Azil (1246), Boulbonne (1253), and Combelongue (1255). In 1251, he built the church at Boulbonne, transferred his ancestors' remains there, and defended it against t
2 CONC he exactions of numerous enemies. He persecuted Catharism, the heresy of his mother, Ermesinda of Castlebon, in order not to be at odds with the Inquisition. He died on February 24, 1265, and was interred in Boulbonne next to his 
2 CONC father.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit]Marriage and children
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger married Brunissenda of Cardona, a daughter of Ramon VIII, Viscount of Cardona. They had six children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger-Bernard III of Foix (d. 1302).
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter of Foix.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sybille of Foix. Married Aimery IV, Viscount of Narbonne.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ines of Foix. Married Eschivat III, Count of Bigorre
2 CONT
2 CONT Philippa of Foix. Married Arnauld, Count of Pailhars.
2 CONT
2 CONT Esclaramunda of Foix. Married James II of Majorca.
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger IV, Comte de Foix es mi #24 bisabuelito padre de Roger- Bernard III  de Foix es mi # 23 bisabuelito, padre de Gaston I, comte de Foix is mi # 22 bisabuelito, padre de Gaston II le Preux, comte de Foix es mi #21 bisabuelito p
2 CONC adre de Gaston III Febus, comte de Foix es mi # 20 bisabuelito padre de Bernardo de Foix, conde de Medinaceli es mi #19 bisabuelito padre de Gaston I de Bearn de la la Cerda,11 es mi #18 bisabuelito padre de Luis de la Cerda,III c
2 CONC onde de Medinaceli es mi # 17 bisabuelito padre de Gaston de la Cerda.IV Conde de Medinaceli es mi #16 bisabuelito padre de Juana de la Cerda, Señora de Monux, Barca y Fresno de Caracena es mi # 15 bisabuelita, madre  de mi#14 bis
2 CONC abuelito Rodrigo de Mendoza ,III Conde de Castrojeriz, padre demi#13 bisabuelito Francisco de Mendoza, padre de mi  #12 bisabuelita Elvira(I) Manrique de Lara y Mendoza madre de mi #11 bisabuelita Elvira(II) Manrique de Lara y Men
2 CONC doza, madre de mi # 10 bisabuelita Elvira(III) Manrique de Lara(y Osorio) madre de mi#9 bisabuelito Antonio Luis de Cabrera y Manrique de Lara, Sgto.Mayor padre de mi #8 bisabuelita Maria Sotomayor y Cabrera Duarte de Meneses, mad
2 CONC re de mi #7Jose de  Escobar Sotomayor Castellanos Cabrera ,padre de mi #6 bisabuelito Jose Castellanos Gallo,padre de mi #5 bisabueltiaMaria Teresa Castellanos Arias Velazques ,madre de mi #4 bisabuelito Justo Pastor Tomas Fernand
2 CONC ez Cornejo Catellanos, padre de mi#3 bisabuelita Narcisa Fernandez Cornejo Elgueta ,madre de mi #2 bisabuelita Ricarda Carolina Francisca Vidal Fernandez Cornejo, madre de mi primera bisabuelita Maria Greoria Benigna Arana Vidal e
2 CONC sposa de mi bisabuelitos Leon Clodoveo Urioste Velazco padres de mi queridísimo abuelito Manuel Tomas Meliton Urioste Arana , esposo de mi queridísima abuelita Maria Julia Teresa Gantier Velazco de Urioste, padres de mi padre Walt
2 CONC er Urioste Gantier.
2 CONT
2 CONT                                        Amalia Maria Rafaela Urioste Prudencio de Murillo G.
