1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was educated at Santes Creus to become a monk, but, knowing his origin, he fled to Naples, inherited the paternal heritage, served Alfonso IV in Sicily, where he married, and died in Palermo leaving Sicilian des
2 CONC cent.
2 CONT
2 CONT Il étudia à Santes Creus pour devenir moine,  mais, connaissant ses origine, il s'enfuit à Naples, hérita du patrimoine paternel, servit Alphonse IV en Sicile, où il se maria, et mourut à Palerme en laissant une descendance sicili
2 CONC enne.
