2 CONT Louis IX, Roi de France was born on 25 April 1215 at Poissy, Île-de-France, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Louis VIII, Roi de France and Blanca de Castilla
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marguerite de Provence, daughter of Raimond Berengar V, Comte de Provence and Beatrice di Savoia, in 1234.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 25 August 1270 at age 55 at Tunis, Tunisia.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried at Saint-Denis, Île-de-France, France.
2 CONT
