2 CONT Reign	8 November 1226 – 25 August 1270 Coronation	29 November 1226 in Reims Cathedral Predecessor	Louis VIII Successor	Philip III Born	25 April 1214 Poissy, France Died	25 August 1270 (aged 56) Tunis, North Africa Burial	Basilica 
