2 CONT Tribonian
2 CONT Lycurgus
2 CONT Hammurabi
2 CONT Moses
2 CONT Solon
2 CONT Papinian
2 CONT Gaius
2 CONT Maimonides
2 CONT Suleiman the Magnificent
2 CONT Pope Innocent III
2 CONT Simon de Montfort
2 CONT Hugo Grotius
2 CONT Sir William Blackstone
2 CONT Napoleon I
2 CONT Thomas Jefferson
