2 CONT (United States House of Representatives:
2 CONT The House of Representatives Chamber has 448 permanent seats. Unlike Senators, Representatives do not have assigned seats.
2 CONT
2 CONT The President delivers the annual State of the Union address in the House chamber
2 CONT
2 CONT It is adorned with relief portraits of famous lawmakers and lawgivers throughout history.
2 CONT In order clockwise around the chamber:
2 CONT
2 CONT George Mason
2 CONT Robert Joseph Pothier
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Colbert
2 CONT Edward I
2 CONT Alfonso X
2 CONT Saint Louis
2 CONT Justinian I
2 CONT Tribonian
2 CONT Lycurgus
2 CONT Hammurabi
2 CONT Moses
2 CONT Solon
2 CONT Papinian
2 CONT Gaius
2 CONT Maimonides
2 CONT Suleiman the Magnificent
2 CONT Pope Innocent III
2 CONT Simon de Montfort
2 CONT Hugo Grotius
2 CONT Sir William Blackstone
2 CONT Napoleon I
2 CONT Thomas Jefferson
