2 CONC ez e Munio Gonzaluez, Nunno Gonzaluz, Maria Gonzaluez, Allionor Gonzaluez, Agnes Gonzaluez, Maior Gonzaluez" ratified donations to the bishopric of Palencia by charter dated 8 May 1222[1139].  "Don Gonzaluo con mi mugier donna Mar
