2 CONC hur II, Duke of Brittany , Marie, Countess of St-Pol  and Blanche, Duchess of Brittany . Marie was grandmother of Marie of Valois ; she was mother to Joan I of Naples . Marie of Valois's sister, Isabella of Valois, Duchess of Bour
2 CONC bon  was mother of Jeanne, Queen of France , Blanca, Queen of Castile , Louis II, Duke of Bourbon  and Bonne, Duchess of Savoy . The third sister was Blanche of Valois , who was the first wife of Charles IV, Holy Roman Emperor  an
