2 CONC ons and three daughters, among them were: Theobald II of Navarre, Beatrice, Duchess of Burgundy and Henry of Navarre. [edit] Descendants
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes' daughter, Blanche married John I, Duke of Brittany. Blanche was mother to John II, Duke of Brittany, who married Beatrice of England and they were parents to: Arthur II, Duke of Brittany, Marie, Countess of St-Pol and Blanc
2 CONC he, Duchess of Brittany.[4]
