2 CONC , p. 42. ^ Jump up to: a b Woodacre 2013, p. 43. Jump up ^ Woodacre 2013, p. 35-36. ^ Jump up to: a b Woodacre 2013, p. 40. ^ Jump up to: a b c Woodacre 2013, p. 37. References[edit] Woodacre, Elena (2013). The Queens Regnant of N
