2 CONT
2 CONT Alfonso and Sancho, surrounded by the women of court. From the Liber feudorum maior.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife, Sancha of Castile, daughter of king Alfonso VII of Castile, b. 1155 or 1157, d. 1208
2 CONT
