1 NOTE He ruled from 1163 to 1196. He inherited Catalonia from his father. Aragon and Catalonia were uneasy bedfellows. In his spare time he wrote poetry int the "Provencal" manner.
1 NOTE Inherited Catalonia from his father and succeeded his mother to the throne of Aragon.  Aragon and Catalonia were uneasy bedfellows.  Alfonso was a spare time poet in the 'Provencial manner.'[Cope.FTW]
