1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''García Sánchez III'''  c. 1012 – 1 September 1054),
2 CONT aka García III de Nájera  was 
2 CONT King of Pamplona from 1034 until his death in 1054.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was also Count of Álava and had control of the County of Castile. As the eldest son of Sancho III he inherited the dynastic rights over the crown of Pamplona
2 CONT House	Jiménez
