2 CONC ucceeded in León.
2 CONT
2 CONT By aiding Ferdinand, García received his brother's favour and, in a repartition of Castile, he expanded Navarre to the bay of Santander and incorporating the entire Basque Country.
2 CONT
2 CONT Soon he was confronted by his brother Ramiro at Tafalla (1043) and defeated him.
2 CONT
