2 CONC Cameros  Ermesinda, married Fortún Sánchez de Yarnoz  Mayor, married Guy II of Masón.  Urraca (d.1108), married García Ordóñez  Jimena  Mencia (d.1106), married Lope de Nájera  He also had illegitimate sons:
