2 CONC  "Michaelem Theodoram Mariam" as the children of "Asanus" and his wife "filiam Angeli Theodori Irenem", also in a later passage naming the second daughter "Annam"[342].  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet b
2 CONC een identified.  m PJOTR, son of ---.  Sébastokrator.  Probably chief regent for Tsar Mihail II Asen after 1246[343].  1253.
