2 CONT ***C2. [1m.] Beloslava, +after 1285; m.ca 1233 King Stefan Vladislav of Raska
2 CONT ***C3. [2m.] Elena, *ca 1224, +ca 1254; m.1235 Emperor Thodoros II Laskaris of Nicaea (*1222 +1258)
2 CONT ***C4. [2m.] Tamara, *after 1220
2 CONT ***C5. [2m.] Koloman I, Tsar of the Bulgarians (1241-46), *ca 1232, +1246
