1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Voir [http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre_de_Navarre '''Wikipedia...''']
2 CONT
2 CONT See: http://www.lebrelblanco.com/anexos/a0169.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT This page gives some very good information about Mosen Pierre. It is pretty convincing to see that King Carlos and Queen Blanca made sure that he received the lands that were his birthright, even though he was illegitimate. There 
2 CONC were no children from the count's actual marriage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT There is further corroboration in "Diccionario del Antiguedades del Reino de Navarra," by D. Jose Yanguas y Miranda. 
