1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Dom Afonso Dinis of Portugal, Lord of Puebla de Salvador Ayres, Majordomo (Steward) of the House of Queen Saint Isabel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Born c.1260 and Died 24 April 1310, he was the natural (i.e. illegitimate) but elevated son of Alfonso III King of Portugal and his royal mistress Maria (also spelled Marinha) Peres de Enxara.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Maria Pais Ribeira 15th Senhora of the powerful House of Sousa. This speaks volumes about Dom Afonso Dinis's actual standing and prestige. Maria Pais Ribeira, as the 15th Senhora of the House of Sousa in her own Right, 
2 CONC was a woman of considerable rank, property, and authority. She was not marrying down or making a desperate match. She was choosing to marry a man - a royal bastard, yes - but a man of demonstrated honor and standing embraced by th
2 CONC e king himself. For a noblewoman of her status to consent to marry Dom Afonso Dinis, he must have been held in genuine esteem by the Portuguese court and nobility. Being by 'illegitimate' birth was clearly not a disqualifying stig
2 CONC ma. Rather, his position as an acknowledged son of the king, his titles (Lord of Puebla de Salvador Ayres), his administrative role in the Queen's own household, and presumably his character and capability, made him a suitable and
2 CONC  honorable match for a woman of her rank. And they would go on to have at least five children:
2 CONT Dom Pedro Afonso de Sousa.
2 CONT Dom Rodrigo Afonso de Sousa, Senhor de Arraiolos e Pavia, Casado com Violante Ponço Briteiros.
2 CONT Dom Diogo Afonso de Sousa, Senhor de Mafra e Ericeira, Casado com Violante Lopes Pacheco.
2 CONT Dom Garcia Mendes de Sousa, prior das Alcáçovas
2 CONT Dom Gonçalo Mendes de Sousa
2 CONT
2 CONT __________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Señor de la Puebla de Salvador Ayres en 1310, Mayordomo de la Casa de la Reina Santa Isabel (su cuñada). 
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Afonso Dinis (c. 1260 - 24 de Abril de 1310), foi um filho ilegítimo do rei Afonso III de Portugal e de Maria Peres de Enxara (ou Marinha Peres de Enxara, provavelmente oriunda de Enxara, hoje no concelho de Mafra). Casou com D
2 CONC . Maria Pais Ribeira, 15ª senhora da Casa de Sousa, enlace do qual teve os seguintes filhos:
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Pedro Afonso de Sousa
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Rodrigo Afonso de Sousa, senhor de Arraiolos e Pavia, casado com Violante Ponço Briteiros
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Diogo Afonso de Sousa, senhor de Mafra e Ericeira, casado com Violante Lopes Pacheco
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Garcia Mendes de Sousa, prior das Alcáçovas
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Gonçalo Mendes de Sousa
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikiwand.com/pt/Louren%C3%A7o_de_Almeida_(capit%C3%A3o-mor)
2 CONT
2 CONT Arvore completa,im, http://genealogias.info/1/upload/lacerdas_lobos_da_vacarica.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Fonte: Gayo, Felgueiras - Nobiliário de famílias de Portugal, Título de Sousas. Braga: Edição de Agostinho de Azevedo Meireles e de Domingos de Araújo Afonso, 1941. Pág. 23, Parágrafo 4, número 14.
