1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.geni.com/people/Nobile-Graziano-de-Vassallo/6000000003955155643?through=6000000003955268239 Was not her husband 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SICILY.htm#PietroIIdied1342B%23ES
2 CONT
2 CONT King Federigo & his wife had nine children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.  GIOVANNI of Sicily (Apr/May 1317-Catania 3 Apr 1348).  The Crónica de San Juan de la Peña names "el primero…Don Pedro…et el otro Don Johan…el tercero Guillem" as the three sons of Federigo King of Sicily, stating that Giovanni
2 CONC  was "Duch de Atenas"[725].  Marchese di Randazzo.  He succeeded his brother 1338 as Duke of Athens and Neopatras, although he never visited the territory.  Regent of Sicily 1338-1348.  He died of the plague.  m CESARINA [Cesarea]
2 CONC  Lancia, daughter of PIETRO Lancia Signor di Delia, Conte di Caltanissetta & his wife --- d'Alagón.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Giovanni & his wife had three children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         FEDERIGO de Aragón ([1340]-11 Jul 1355, bur Santa Agata Palermo).  He succeeded his father in 1348 as Duke of Athens and Neopatras. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         LEONOR de Aragón ([1346]-after 1369).  m GUILLÉN de Peralta Conde de Castelbellotta. 
2 CONT
2 CONT c)         '''CONSTANZA de Aragón'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *Costance is mentioned and nothing else in the father's wiki, only in ENG. Nothing in other languages.
2 CONT *nothing about husband Graziano
2 CONT *nothing about Vassallo
2 CONT ------
2 CONT The following was sourced from the following website: Ancestors of John Cilia La Corte 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1986816. Graziano de Vassallo,58 son of Vassallo de Vassallo and Eleonora de Antiochi, was born circa 1295. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1986817. Costanza d'Aragona,58 daughter of Juan de Aragón, Duke of Athens, Count of Malta and Cesarea Lanza. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I am presuming that Juan is the Spanish and Giovanni is the Italian version of the same name, just as Constance is the Anglised form of the Spanish Constanza. I haven't worked out what the 58 is after Graziano and Constanza's name
2 CONC s. (Robyn Thorncraft)
2 CONT
