2 CONT He was born in Venice, the grandson of Andrew II of Hungary (reigned 1205-35), being the only son of Andrew II's youngest and posthumous son (possibly illegitimate), '''Stephen, Duke of Slavonia''' who was born of the old king's t
2 CONC hird marriage with Beatrice d'Este. His mother was Tomasina Morosini, descendant of a Venetian patrician family.
