2 CONT
2 CONT f)          ALESSINA (-before 18 Jan 1305).  The Chronica Jacobi de Aquis, dated to 1334, records that the two daughters of "Marchio Guliermus" and his wife "Beatricem filiam regis Anfoxi de Hispania" married "una…in Roma D. Ponze
2 CONC llo filio D. Ursi de Ursinis…nepoti Papæ" and that they had "filius…Petrus"[268].  Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by the testament of "Johannes…marchio Montisferrati", dated 18 Jan 1305, which appoints as his heirs "fili
2 CONC os Alaxine sororis sue condam et uxoris Puncelli de filiis Ursi", and failing them "filium Margarite sororis sue condam uxoris Johannis infantis de Yspania de Castella"[269].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (before 1305) PONCELLO Orsini Patrician of Rome, son of ORSINO Orsini & his wife --- (-after 1314). 
