2 CONC Maria Diaz de Haro was married at a young age with the Infante Juan of Castile, Lord of Valencia de Campos who was brother of King Sancho el Bravo. Son's wedding this second son of Alfonso X of Castile "The Wise" was held on Janua
2 CONC ry 10th of 1287. Their children were John (Yañez de Castilla) The Eye, murdered 1326, Lopez and Alonso. The latter two died without leaving a successor.
