2 CONC ren of Beatrice of Swabia. Diego Lopez IV died in 1289, just a year after his father died, leaving no descendants, so the title passed to belong to Mary, according to opinion of the Basques, although real power was in fact by the 
2 CONC force of weapons in the hands of Sancho IV.
2 CONT
2 CONT This first period lasted Lady of Biscay since 1289 until 1295.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Edit] Usurpation of Lordship
2 CONT
