2 CONC ing Ferdinand IV child María de Molina which is used by Diego Lopez de Haro V, with the support of James II, King of Aragon, Vizcaya and snatch to take the estate to her niece Mary and the Lord's consort, her uncle John Alfónsez C
2 CONC astilian Infante.
