2 CONT Once legalized the succession "irregular" for the papacy of Sancho IV and Ferdinand IV, in March 1307 reunited the General Meetings of the Lordship of Biscay in Arechabalaga Don Diego "The Intruder" recognizes Maria Diaz de Haro a
2 CONC s a legitimate heir to the Lordship and required to be accepted as Lady of Biscay when he dies, what will happen in 1310.
