2 CONT [Edit] Second stint as head of the Manor
2 CONT
2 CONT In the early days of the year 1300 Diego Lopez de Haro V, based Bilbao and falls dead in 1309 during the siege of Algeciras where it was, next to King Ferdinand IV, the war against the Muslims.
