2 CONT In fiction
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor is the protagonist of The Queen From Provence, a historical romance by British novelist Jean Plaidy which was published in 1979. Eleanor is a main character in the novel Four Sisters, All Queens by author Sherry Jones, as 
2 CONC well as in the novel The Sister Queens by Sophie Perinot.
2 CONT
