2 TITL Eleanor of Provence
2 NOTE HENRY III - Plantagenet King of England, born Oct 1, 1207 in Winchester, England; died Nov 16, 1272 in Westminster, England. He was the son of JOHN I "Lackland" Plantagenet King of England and ISABELLA Taillefer of Angouleme Queen
3 CONC  of England. He married ELEANOR Berenger Countess of Provence Jan 14, 1235/36 in Cathedral Canterbury, England.
3 CONT
