1 NOTE King Edward I of England, Lord of Ireland, Duke of Aquitaine
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=image&guid=a73bc6db-d9dd-4fba-b7e3-a3c3f5f3daf5&tid=6959821&pid=-1169288156
1 NOTE Edward I & Eleanor of castile
