2 CONT he is noted for encouraging Parliamentary institutions at the expense of
2 CONT feudalism and for subduing Wales on which he imposed the English system of
2 CONT administration. He later tried to assert his authority over Scotland and died
2 CONT while on his way to fight Robert Bruce.
