1 NOTE was born 17 Jun 1239 in Westminster Palace London England. He died 7 Jul 1307 in Burgh-by-Sands and was buried in Westminster Abbey, London, England. Edward married Eleanor of CASTILE on 18 Oct 1254 in Abbey of Las Huelgas, Burgos
