1 NOTE King Edward I
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=image&guid=f6235cda-fc04-4248-8ccb-cb8b7e65e529&tid=10771688&pid=-518432443
1 NOTE !SOURCES:
2 CONT     1. Dict. of Nat'l Biog., Eng. Pub. A, v. 6, p. 432, v. 17, p. 14-48
2 CONT     2. Royal Dau of Engl, Eng. 120, v. 1, p. 61, 172-209
2 CONT     3. Burke's Peerage, Eng. P, 1949, pref. p. 254
2 CONT     4. The Complete Peerage, G.E.C., Eng. V, v. 5, p. 708-12, v. 6, p. 469
