3 NOTE After reading the comments below, I think the Royal Family has a lot of competition for the throne of England.  How in Heaven's name did a Hanover gain the Kingdom of England?
3 NOTE Kink Edward is my 22nd Great grandfather and King John is my 23rd Great grandfather.
3 NOTE John is my 21st great grandfather....   :)  and Edward I is my 20th great grandfather on my moms side .... and Edward II is my 20th great grandfather on my dads side......
3 NOTE That's Funny, Michael! He's also, my 24th and 25th Great Grandfather. May I suggest, a tasteful gray or dark blue 3pc. suit? Although, I would avoid bow ties, a tie would likely, be required, too. 😉👍🏼 💖
3 NOTE So, following a dear John letter to the present Royal family, I introduce myself as the 23 rd. Great Grandson of John Lackland, King of England.... An  American comes for a visit to the ancestral homes, what should I wear?
