2 CONT REF: Sharon Kay Penman, "The Reckoning": Split with his brother Edwardover the latter's decision, after he took Nazareth (1271-1272), to allowhis men to kill the Arab townsfolk, in reprisal for the Arabs' massacreof Christians at 
2 CONC Jaffa & Antioch.
