2 CONT
2 CONT Jean was born in 1295 in St. Pol, Nord, Nord Pas De Calais, France.  He died at the age of 49 in 1344 in St. Pol-Sur-Mer, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean's family with Jeanne de Fiennes
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean and Jeanne were married in a religious ceremony in December 1329 in France.  They had a daughter named Maud.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Maud de Chatillon
2 CONT
2 CONT Maud was born in 1339 in Ligny et Barrois, Meuse, France.  She died at the age of 39 in 1378 in Saint Pol.
