2 CONC fe Anastasia van Moorslede (-22 Oct 1455, bur Ypres Jacobins). Documents dated 10 Jan 1420 (N.S.) and Apr 1421 name “mer Heylaerd van Pouke, zuene was van mer Heylaerd van Poke” and “Anastasie van Oultre burgraefnede van Yppre...w
2 CONC eduwe van Heulaerde heer van Pouke” and her husband “Robrecht van Vlaanderen”[829]. A manuscript records that “Robert B. de Flandres...” married “Dame Anastasia d’Outre Vicomtesse heritiere d’Ipre, Dame de Weldene, vefve de Monsie
