2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Gaston VII de Montcada (Latin: Guasto de Biarde; 1225–26 April 1290), called Froissard, was the twentieth Viscount of Béarn from 1229. He was the son and heir of William II Raymond and Garsenda, daughter of Alfonso II of Provence 
2 CONC and Garsenda of Forcalquier.
