1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_Kerdeston
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with her husband, John de Foix, 1st Earl of Kendal: 
2 CONT
2 CONT -Gaston de Foix, Count of Candale (ca. 1448-1500), 1st wife Infanta Catherine of Navarre (ca. 1455 – before 1494), issue, including Anna of Foix-Candale queen of Hungary, 2nd wife Isabel of Albret, the daughter of Alain I of Albre
2 CONC t (d. ca. 1530), other children.
2 CONT
2 CONT -John (d. 1521) Viscount of Meille in Aragon, Count of Fleix and Gurson, his wife Anne de Villeneuve (d. 1567): issue, the dukes of Randan.
2 CONT
2 CONT -Catherine (d. 1510), her husband Charles I Count of Armagnac (1425-1497): without issue
2 CONT
2 CONT -Margaret (d. 1534/36), her husband, Louis II Margrave of Saluzzo (1438-1504): issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Margaret Kerdeston1,2,3,4
2 CONT *'''F, #80967, b. circa 1426, d. after 5 December 1485
2 CONT *Father      Sir Thomas Kerdeston1,2,5,6 d. 20 Jul 1446
2 CONT *Mother     Elizabeth de la Pole1,2,5,6 d. 3 Apr 1440
2 CONT *'''     Margaret Kerdeston was born circa 1426 at of Claxton & Kerdeston, Norfolk, England.2 She married Sir Jean de Foix, Earl of Kendal, Comte de Benauges, son of Gaston de Foix, Captal de Buch, Seigneur de Grailly, Comte de Lo
2 CONC ngueville & Benauges and Marguerite d' Albret, before 12 May 1446; They had 2 sons (Gaston, Count of Candale & Bénauges, Captal de Buch, Seneschal de Guyenne; & Jean, Comte de Gurson & Fleix, Vicomte de Meilles) and 2 daughters (C
2 CONC atherine, wife of Charles, Comte d'Armagnac, Vicomte de Fezensaguet; & Marguerite, wife of Ludovico II, Marchese di Saluzzo).7,8,2,3,4 Margaret Kerdeston died after 5 December 1485.7,8,2,3,4
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir Jean de Foix, Earl of Kendal, Comte de Benauges d. b 31 Dec 1493
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Gaston II de Foix, Comte de Kendal & Benauges+7 d. a 25 Mar 1500
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 173.
2 CONT * 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 687-689.
2 CONT * 3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 43.
2 CONT * 4.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 419.
2 CONT * 5.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 42.
2 CONT * 6.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 417-418.
2 CONT * 7.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. III, Tafel 149.
2 CONT * 8.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. VII, p. 110.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2695.htm#i80967 __________________________
2 CONT *'''The Royal Descents of 600 Immigrants to the American Colonies Or the United States: Who Were Themselves Notable Or Left Descendants Notable in American History
2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=z1FlAAAAMAAJ&focus=searchwithinvolume&q=kerdeston
2 CONT *Pg.xxii
2 CONT * .... I might also note that '''Margaret de Kerdeston, wife of John de Foix, 1st Earl of Kendal, grandmother''' of Anne de Foix, Queen of Bohemia and Hungary, and most recent English ancestress of many European sovereigns, appear
2 CONC s on pp. 368-69; among her first cousins was Anne Morley, wife of John Hastings ....
2 CONT *Pg.145
2 CONT *''' John de Foix, 1st Earl of Kendal, and Margaret de Kerdeston''', SETH. Gaston II de Foix, Count of Benauges married Catherine de Foix, a cousin and left a daughter, Anne de Foix, who married Ladislaus V, King of Bohemia and Hu
2 CONC ngary. Their daughter, Anne of Bohemia married Ferdinand I, Holy  ....
2 CONT *Pg.368
2 CONT *   7. Elizabeth de la Pole = Sir Thomas de Kerdeston
2 CONT *'''   8 Margaret de Kerdeston = John de Foix, 1st Earl of Kendal (their son''', Gaston III de Foix, Count of Benauges, married firstly Catherine de Foix, his cousin, niece of the half blood of Ferdinand I, 1st King of united Spai
