1 NOTE His crafty and cruel character provoked civil wars from 1458 to 1462 and 
2 CONT in 1485 and alienated Pope Callistus III in 1458 and Pope Innocent VIII 
2 CONT (1432-92) from 1484 to 1492. During Ferdinand's reign the printing press 
2 CONT was introduced (1474) into Naples, and the Turks occupied (1480-81) 
