2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT Beatrice married on 5 June 1219 Ramon Berenguer IV, Count of Provence. She was a shrewd and politically astute woman, whose beauty was likened to that of a second Niobe by Matthew Paris. Ramon and Beatrice of Savoy had four daught
2 CONC ers, who all lived to adulthood, and married kings. Their only son, Raymond died in early infancy.[2]
