2 CONT Grandchildren
2 CONT
2 CONT     Joan II of Navarre
2 CONT
2 CONT     John I
2 CONT
2 CONT     Joan III, Countess and Duchess of Burgundy
2 CONT
2 CONT     Margaret I, Countess of Burgundy
2 CONT
2 CONT     Isabella, Dauphine of Viennois
2 CONT
