2 CONT
2 CONT     * André, Histoire de Ste Isabelle, Carpentras, 1885.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Daniélo, Vie de Madame Ste Isabelle, Paris, 1840.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Berguin, La Bienheureuse Isabelle de France, Grenoble, 1899.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Duchesne, Histoire de l'abbaye royale de Longchamp, 12557–1789, Paris, 1904.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Sbaralea, Bull. Franc., III, Rome, 1765, 64-9.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Sbaralea, Bull. Franc., II, Rome, 1761, 477-86.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Sean L. Field, Isabelle of France: Capetian Sanctity and Franciscan Identity in the Thirteenth Century (University of Notre Dame Press, 2006).
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Sean L. Field, ed. and trans., The Writings of Agnes of Harcourt: The Life of Isabelle of France and the Letter on Louis IX and Longchamp (University of Notre Dame Press, 2003).
2 CONT
