1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I suspect that there may be certain things with Rodrigo, Caballero Hidalgo which are terribly wrong.  He may have been completely invented, out of scratch.  Two facts in support of this argument.  First, the contri
2 CONC butor of his entry claims that Rodrigo died in Chile in 1509.  But this is impossible because Chile did not exist until Almagro and Valdivia in 1540-1541.  Second, according to the respected historian Gabriel Guarda, the grandfath
2 CONC er of that Escobar who was killed by the Dutch in Castro in 1600 was a different Escobar, someone who was the official escribano to Columbus in his first expedition to the Americas.  That Escobar would have officially recorded the
2 CONC  discovery of the Americas by Columbus.  
