2 CONC mayor of Alfonso IX King of Leon 6 Mar 1189 to 30 Aug 1189.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly DIEGO Jiménez de los Cameros, son of JIMENO Iñíguez & his second wife Endulcia --- (-after 20 Aug 1181). 
