1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guillem_Galceran_de_Rocabert%C3%AD
2 CONT
2 CONT Guillem Galceran de Rocabertí i de Serrallonga (1320 - 1385), Baron of Cabrenys, lord of Maçanet, Hostoles and Reiners. [1] The Rocabertí de Cabrenys lineage began . [2] He was the son of the Viscount of Rocabertí Dalmau VII and b
2 CONC rother of what would become Viscount Jofre V of Rocabertí . He was a trusted man of Peter III the Ceremonious . In 1351 he was one of the magnates who signed the erection of the duchy of Girona as witnesses and later took part in 
2 CONC the war of the two Peres . He died in 1385.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Maria d'Arborea , daughter of Judge Hugh II of Arborea , and they had at least two children: Guerau Galceran de Rocabertí and Guillem Hug de Rocabertí , who succeeded each other in the inheritance of the father, the bar
2 CONC ony of Cabrenys .
