2 CONC mily in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana names “Jofre V †1342” as son of Dalmau.  The primary source which confirms this information have not been identified.  Vescomte de Rocabertí.  The primary source which confirms his parentage 
2 CONC has not been identified.  Salazar y Castro records his testament dated 15 Jul 1341 (no source cited)[1649]. 
