2 CONC nzaluez e Munio Gonzaluez, Nunno Gonzaluz, Maria Gonzaluez, Allionor Gonzaluez, Agnes Gonzaluez, Maior Gonzaluez" ratified donations to the bishopric of Palencia by charter dated 8 May 1222[191].  Salazar y Castro records her pare
2 CONC ntage and marriage[192]. 
2 CONT
