2 CONC Ladislaus of Siebenbuergen; he had issue of whom I have no details
2 CONT *****E2. Urosic, a monk, +ca 1306
2 CONT *****E3. Jelisaveta, *ca 1270, +1331; m.after 1283 Stefan Kotroman, Ban of Bosnia (+1314/16)
2 CONT ****D2. Stepan Uros II Milutin, King of Serbia (1282-1321), *ca 1253, +Castle Nerodimlja 29.10.1321, bur Sofia; 1m: 1273/76 (repudiated 1283) Helene Angelina, dau.of Joannes Dukas Angelos, Sebastokrator in Neopatros; 2m: 1284 (rep
2 CONC udiated ca 1294) Ana, dau.of Tsar George Terter of Bulgaria; 3m: ca 1295 (repudiated 1298/9) Elizabeth of Hungary (*1255, +1313/26); 4m: ca 1300 Simonida Palaiologina (*1292/93, +after 1336)
2 CONT ***** ...
2 CONT ****D3. Brnca; m.Zupan Djordje
