1 NOTE Philippa`s tomb in Westminster Abbey cost her husband, Edward III, 300 pounds, making the monument one of the most expensive in the Abbey.
1 NOTE No. 546629 George Washington Ahnentafel !SOURCE: International Society of the Descendants of Charlemagne, Inc.
2 CONT
