2 CONC t de Foix German: Von Frankreich Birth: =1458= Clisson, Loire-Atlantique, Pays de la Loire, France Death: 15 May 1486 Of, Bretagne, France It means he has reincarnated some centuries after his dead? Because he married Margarrita d
