2 CONT      Ladislas III Arpád, King of Hungary was born in 1199.1 He was the son of Emeric Arpád, King of Hungary and Constanza de Aragón. (1) He died in 1205. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Ladislas III Arpád, King of Hungary held the office of Co-regent of Hungary in 1204. (2) He gained the title of King Ladislas III of Hungary in 1204. (1)
2 CONT
