2 CONT *Mistress (4): ---.  Benoist-Méchin says that the mother of the emperor´s daughter Katharina was "une femme appartenant à la lignée des ducs de Spolète" but cites no corresponding source[659].  There may be some confusion with the
2 CONC  alleged mother of Enzio who, according to the same source, was "de la Maison de Spolète" (see above). 
