1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Marriage and descendants
1 CONT
1 CONT Afonso married Beatrice of Castile (1293-1359) in 1309, daughter of Sancho IV, King of Castile, and Maria de Molia and had four sons and three daughters.
1 CONT Name Birth Death Notes
1 CONT By Beatrice of Castile (1293-1359; married in 1309)
