0 @N6000000005076836405@ NOTE John of England was born circa 1250 at Windsor Castle, Windsor, Berkshire, England.2 He was the son of Henry III, King of England and Eleanor of Provence. He died before 1256.2 He was buried at Westminster Abbey, Westminster, Lond
1 CONC on, England.2
