1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Legacy
1 CONT When Emeric died, his infant son briefly became king but died in 1205. Emeric's brother Andrew became king. Constance, meanwhile, fled to Vienna and eventually married the Emperor Frederick II.
1 CONT
1 CONT
