1 CONT Robert I de France, Comte d'Artois was born in September 1216. He was the son of Louis VIII, Roi de France and Blanca de Castilla. He married Matilde de Brabant, daughter of Henri II, Duc de Brabant and Marie von Hohenstaufen, in 
1 CONC 1237.1 He died on 9 February 1250 at age 33 at Mansourah, Egypt, killed.
1 CONT      Robert I de France, Comte d'Artois gained the title of Comte d'Artois.2
1 CONT Children of Robert I de France, Comte d'Artois and Matilde de Brabant
