1 CONC  1254, Abbey of Las Huelgas, Burgos, Castile to , Eleanor of Castile, Cts de Ponthieu   Child 1: , Eleanor, Princess, b. 17 JUN 1264 Child 2: , Joan, b. 1265 Child 3: , John, b. 10 JUL 1266 Child 4: , Henry, b. 13 JUL 1267 Child 5
