1 CONT Born: 17 JUN 1239, Westminster Palace, London, England
1 CONT Acceded: 19 AUG 1274, Westminster Abbey, London, England
1 CONT Died: 7 JUL 1307, Burgh-on-the-Sands, Near Carlisle
