1 CONT Louis II Duke of Anjou
1 CONT Count of Maine, Provence, Forcalquier and Piedmont
1 CONT 1417–1434 Succeeded by
1 CONT René
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT — Duke of Calabria
1 CONT 1426–1434
