1 CONT Naples in 1381, Charles and Margaret seized Naples and imprisoned Joan, whom
1 CONT Charles ordered killed the following year, 1382. Louis then named himself
1 CONT King and invaded southern Italy, but Louis's death in September left Charles
1 CONT master of Naples.
0 @N6000000002322305105@ NOTE Charles was a leading figure of the Hungarian branch of the Angevin dynasty;
