1 CONT becoming an heir to the Neopolitan throne. Later, with the death of Louis I
1 CONT of Hungary, Charles claimed the throne, and was crowned King of Hungary in
1 CONT 1385. Elizabeth, widowed queen of Louis, ordered the death of Charles in 1386.
