1 CONT Frederick II King of Sicily
1 CONT 1212–1217 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Frederick II 
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Frederick II Duke of Swabia
1 CONT 1216–1235 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Conrad IV 
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Frederick II King of Germany
1 CONT 1220–1235 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Conrad IV 
